{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日，馬斯克旗下SpaceX SI（註：原AI）放出一則出圈招聘啓事，崗位是壽司廚師，給出了優厚薪資，但對體能要求堪稱苛刻。這個崗位服務於xAI位於孟菲斯的Colossus超算集羣園區，給長期高強度攻堅的工程師團隊提供餐飲配套。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584282.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:02:22.917029+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:41:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_hash":"059c460c128997f95b7e144458e67c3f41e99c3b9ebc3314b49a845b72491d87","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}